raye-files (25.12.3+raye6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Map network drive: connect a shared folder (\\server\share) into a
    folder of yours, as a guest or with a name and password kept in the
    wallet, and reconnect it at sign-in. Disconnect from the right-click
    menu.
  * This PC lists the computers and NAS found on the network, and network
    drives with their space, or Disconnected when they are offline.
  * Network drives show up under This PC in the navigation pane and in
    the address bar.
  * Properties of a network drive or location say what it is: the shared
    folder, the computer, SMB, the space. No more Local Disk or cifs.
  * Right-click a drive in This PC for new tab, new window, pin, eject,
    format, copy as path and properties.
  * Recycle Bin gets Empty Recycle Bin, Restore all items and Restore the
    selected items in the command bar, and Empty in the navigation pane.
  * Right-click files and folders on Home and pictures in Gallery.
  * Gallery's Collection can add any folder.

