raye-files (25.12.3+raye5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Files opens, extracts and makes archives with the Raye archive
    engine: ZIP, 7z, RAR, tar and more open like folders, even with no
    extension. Extract all, Extract here and Extract to; Compress to
    ZIP, 7z or tar.zst; an Add to archive window with levels, methods,
