raye-files (25.12.3+raye3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Files opens as a Windows-style window: tabs in the title row,
    address row with search, command bar, navigation pane, Details and
    Preview pane, and a status bar that says "12 items | 1 item selected
    2.4 MB".
  * New This PC (drives with usage bars, phones and cameras, network
    locations) and Gallery (pictures and videos by month, rows that fill
    the width, a Collection menu to pick its folders).
  * The eight Windows views in View (Ctrl+Shift+1 to 8), Ctrl+1 to 9 to
    switch tabs, and the File Explorer keys for search, address, panes,
    new folder and full screen.
  * New Properties dialog: General, Security in plain words, Details for
    pictures, videos and music, and a drive page with its space and
    Clean up. The full dialog stays behind Advanced settings.
  * A new window and Meta+E open Home, and the places list is set up
    like Quick access on first start.
  * New offers Folder, Shortcut, Text document and Compressed (zipped)
    folder, and a new file starts with its name ready to type. Column
    headers are never cut.
  * Files follows the new Raye Night and Day colours.

